# Enemy: "Sobok Gwisin" (소복 귀신). A folklore ghost in a white mourning
# hanbok (소복) with long hair over her face; the hem fades out instead of feet.
# 24x40 frames, front view. float_0/float_1 loop; reveal shows one eye.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 24 40
@output ../characters/enemy_sobok_gwisin.png
@preview ../previews/enemy_sobok_gwisin_x4.png 4
@columns 3

@frame float_0
